WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Hey, where are you going?

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.000
Before you leave, I have a question.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
How much money are you leaving on the table by not having a conversation with your clients regarding planning for long-term care?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Unfortunately, there are only one of two things that happen as we get older.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:22.000
We either die, or our body and brain starts to fail us, and we find ourselves looking to others to help with our everyday activities

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
of daily living such as bathing, dressing, feeding, toileting, transferring, and maintaining our continence.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.800
Take a look at the quick calculations on the screen below.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:39.800
You decide how many new clients or policies you can sell in a year, and the commission revenue numbers take care of themselves.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:45.000
We have a motto: if you don't ask, you don't get.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.800
So why not ask your clients if they've considered the emotional, physical, and financial consequences of not planning for long-term care?

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.800
If you don't, your competition just might.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.200
We hope to see you return to try out this long-term care asset utilization modeling tool.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.000
Thanks for visiting.
